stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    state "Any declared UAV status" as AnyStatus
    state "Update rejected" as Rejected

    [*] --> AnyStatus: register with any non-null status
    AnyStatus --> AnyStatus: replace with any non-null status
    AnyStatus --> Rejected: null status
    Rejected --> AnyStatus: stored value unchanged

    note right of AnyStatus
        GROUND · TAKING_OFF · FLYING
        RETURNING_HOME · LANDING · DISCONNECTED

        No transition matrix is enforced.
    end note
